### 3. NOTEBOOK / TABLET
- **Notebook**: Apple MacBook, Casper, Lenovo, Tecno
- **Tablet**: iPad Serisi, Samsung Galaxy Tab, Lenovo Tab

### 4. VİNN (Modem/Router)
